  "rte": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>OsteoSet resorbable beads are mixed and molded at the point of use to support new bone regeneration by acting as a passive osteoconductive scaffold for native bone to remodel. They are digitally packed into open bone voids/gaps not intrinsic to the stability of the bony structure and can address surgically created, osseous, or traumatic injury.</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 18 2022 20:05:52 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  }
